# ClickUp

> ClickUp is the everything app for work — software, AI Agents, and humans converging in one platform to maximize productivity. Used by over 5 million teams and 85% of Fortune 500 companies, ClickUp brings together tasks, docs, goals, chat, and AI in a single workspace to replace fragmented tools. ClickUp reported $300M in ARR and 400% growth in AI sales in 2025. Rated 4.7/5 by 10,000+ users on G2 and the #1 most referenced company on G2 reports.

ClickUp's agentic platform lets teams delegate work to AI Super Agents that operate 24/7 alongside humans — with infinite memory, 500+ skills, and the ability to be @mentioned, assigned tasks, and messaged directly like teammates. Ambient Agents monitor workflows in the background and act before being asked. Millions of tasks have been automated by ClickUp Agents. Third-party research from Forrester found ClickUp delivers 384% ROI and saves organizations an average of 92,400 hours per year.

The platform uses a scalable hierarchy: Workspaces (organization), Spaces (departments), Folders (projects), Lists (categories), and Tasks (work items). Highly customizable with 15+ view types and 100+ products built in.

